@node Top
@top tandem

tandem lets you pair-program with Claude inside Emacs.  Claude runs in a
background daemon, @command{tandemd}, which drives your own Claude Code
(@command{claude}).  You chat with Claude in an Emacs buffer, review
every edit it proposes in the file's own buffer, keep the lines it wrote
in colour, and let it ask Emacs what Emacs knows.

tandem is an independent project, formerly called claude-pair.  It is
not made, endorsed or supported by Anthropic.  Claude and Claude Code
are trademarks of Anthropic, PBC.

This manual is for version @value{VERSION}.
@end ifnottex

